# LLM login profiles: one row per account. Paths may start with ~.
# login-match: comma-separated email suffixes (or full addresses) that identify this profile's logins.
# claude-config-dir "default" = CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR unset (login in ~/.claude.json). At most one profile should use it.
# aliases: optional extra names for `claude <alias>` / `codex <alias>`.
# profile	login-match	claude-config-dir	codex-home	aliases (optional)
acme	@acme.example	default	~/.codex
globex	@globex.example	~/.claude-globex	~/.codex-globex	gx
personal	you@example.com	~/.claude-personal	~/.codex-personal
